  1114	/**
  1115	 * Hangs every canopy cluster of `mesh` upside down 7 to 11 m over the ground, lifted where needed
  1116	 * so its lowest leaf stays `CANOPY_CLEARANCE` above the visitor and the camera behind them.
  1117	 */
